{"chunk":"Lot Frontage: Building on rear of a lot. SECTION 15-1 Floor Area Ratio\n\n            Floor Area Ratio is the ratio of the total area of all floors in the building to the\n            area of the lot. It measures building density directly and population density indirectly. Examples\n\n               To calculate maximum gross floor area on a lot:\n\n                  Lot size (3,500 sq. ft.) x F.A.R. (0.8) = 2,800 sq.","document":"APPENDICES_TO_ZONING_CODE","city":"boston","heading_1":"APPENDICES TO ZONING CODE","heading_2":"APPENDIX 2 ILLUSTRATIONS","url":"https:\/\/library.municode.com\/MA\/Boston\/codes\/Redevelopment_Authority?nodeId=APPENDICES_ZONING_CODE_APX2IL","district_code":[],"district_category":[],"embedding":[0.0062850486,0.0119536044,0.0141446507,-0.0243179202,-0.0031466365,-0.0088205887,-0.0107553238,-0.0148717891,-0.0016674354,-0.0057897079,0.0474691465,0.0163065922,0.0322720632,-0.0216401555,-0.0064772139,0.0064465194,0.0384300202,0.0356956385,-0.0171352979,-0.0211847126,0.0062393378,-0.0026369044,-0.0228894316,-0.0548949577,-0.0365381464,-0.0188568253,-0.0245116893,-0.0643615946,0.0102237705,-0.0116219763,0.0299549643,-0.0338899493,0.0352099091,-0.027583899,0.0259095244,-0.0103785442,-0.0075450083,-0.0253686812,0.0402816609,0.0327548496,-0.0637250766,0.0101018939,-0.0111576971,0.0502953678,-0.037299566,-0.097884655,-0.0083293645,0.0368447639,-0.0165840704,0.0082433717,0.0157784633,0.0261134505,-0.0520839505,0.0123169161,-0.0177860167,-0.0446847193,0.0308562405,-0.0095560132,0.0350975469,-0.0049088658,0.0042785155,-0.0472212285,0.0108649461,0.0038027782,0.0259616785,0.0275636707,-0.0118506663,-0.0854911655,-0.0895209685,0.0467710681,-0.0349519253,0.0646024197,-0.0676368102,0.0485552922,0.0353208333,-0.0418230183,0.016080251,-0.0172752216,0.0344734117,0.0295823049,-0.0936766043,0.0030238195,0.0036955951,-0.0038843143,0.013941423,-0.0299086235,0.0110686105,-0.0861714333,-0.0300880913,-0.0473274328,0.0466420464,0.0558248013,-0.051850792,0.024